!!! 16-names-and-case.matrix
!!!
!!! Identifier spelling: case folding and hyphenated words.
!!!
!!! Matrix is case-insensitive at the language level, and a hyphen joins the
!!! words of a single name. Both exist for one reason: an agent should not be
!!! able to misname something it has already seen.
!!!
!!! The hyphen is available because arithmetic is spelled with words. "minus"
!!! is subtraction and negation, so "-" is never an operator and is free to
!!! be a letter. The verbosity of word operators is what buys it -- the two
!!! decisions pay for each other.

book naming.demonstration

!!! --- Case folding ------------------------------------------------------
!!!
!!! Keywords fold: BEGIN CHOICE, Begin Choice and begin choice are one token
!!! pair. Lowercase is the canonical spelling and a formatter normalises to
!!! it; the other spellings are accepted, not recommended.
!!!
!!! Folding is ASCII-only. A non-ASCII letter in an identifier compares
!!! byte-exact and is never folded. This is deliberate: full Unicode case
!!! folding is locale-dependent -- Turkish dotless i, German sharp s -- and
!!! two identifiers that fold together while looking different is a
!!! confusable-name hazard, not a convenience.

!!! --- Hyphens -----------------------------------------------------------
!!!
!!! A hyphen joins words INSIDE one name. A space separates terms in an
!!! expression. The two are never interchangeable.
!!!
!!! Legal:    frame-kind      read-regular-bytes      crc-seed
!!!           frame-kind2     x2                      kind
!!! Illegal:  -kind           kind-            frame--kind
!!!           total-1         (a hyphen must be followed by a letter)
!!!
!!! "total-1" is a lex error, not an undefined identifier, so the habit of
!!! writing "total - 1" fails at the hyphen with a message that names the
!!! actual rule rather than reporting a missing name.

!!! --- One name, many spellings -------------------------------------------
!!!
!!! An identifier's LOOKUP KEY is its ASCII-lowercased spelling with every
!!! hyphen and underscore removed. These four are therefore one name:
!!!
!!!     frame-kind      FRAME-KIND      frame_kind      framekind
!!!
!!! Underscores are accepted on input and fold with hyphens, which is what
!!! lets Matrix call Ny's snake_case library functions in kebab-case:
!!! "read-regular-bytes" resolves to ny.lang.io's "read_regular_bytes".
!!!
!!! A declaration's EMITTED NIL SYMBOL is its exact spelling at the
!!! declaration site, with hyphens rewritten to underscores -- because Ny
!!! identifiers admit no hyphen, so a Matrix name containing one would be
!!! unnameable from Ny. Declaring "frame-kind" emits "frame_kind", which Ny
!!! spells "frame_kind". Cross-language references are case-sensitive, since
!!! Ny is; Matrix-internal references are not.

frame-kind begin choice
    when Heartbeat
    when Sample holding number
end choice

!!! Capitals carry no meaning once folding applies, so SCREAMING-CASE cannot
!!! mark a constant. The "constant" keyword does that, and the capitals are a
!!! human signal with no semantic weight: MAX-PAYLOAD and max-payload are the
!!! same name.
constant MAX-PAYLOAD as number is 64

public variable frames-seen as number is 0

sensor-reading begin record
    field sensor-id as number
    field raw-value as number
end record

read-sensor receives sensor-id as number returns sensor-reading begin paragraph
    give build sensor-reading with sensor-id being sensor-id, raw-value being (sensor-id becomes number)
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    !!! Every one of these spellings resolves to the one declaration above.
    !!! A formatter rewrites them all to the declaration's spelling, so
    !!! case-insensitivity cannot quietly degrade into an inconsistent file.
    value first  is read-sensor with sensor-id being 1
    value second is READ-SENSOR with SENSOR-ID being 2
    value third  is Read_Sensor with sensor_id being 3
    value fourth is readsensor  with sensorid  being 4

    say first.raw-value
    say second.raw-value
    say third.raw-value
    say fourth.raw-value

    !!! Keywords fold too. This is legal and deliberately ugly: the formatter
    !!! exists so that nobody has to read it twice.
    VALUE total AS NUMBER IS first.raw-value PLUS second.raw-value
    SAY total

    !!! A hyphen inside a name, a space between terms. Nothing here is
    !!! subtraction -- subtraction is "minus".
    value gap as number is third.raw-value minus first.raw-value
    say gap

    set frames-seen to frames-seen plus 4
    say frames-seen

    !!! Reserved words still collide, and folding makes it worse: a collision
    !!! cannot be escaped by capitalising, because `Value` IS `value`. The
    !!! backtick escape is the last resort; renaming is the better answer.
    value `text` as text is "an identifier that had to be escaped"
    say `text`

    give 0
end paragraph
